"lemma":"நெஞ்சத்துக்","gloss":"of the heart"}],"gloss":"of the heart","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காதல்","parts":[{"text":"காதல்","lemma":"kātal","gloss":"love"}],"gloss":"love"},{"surface":"கொள்ளாப்","parts":[{"text":"கொள்ளாப்","lemma":"கொள்ளாப்","gloss":"not having"}],"gloss":"not having","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பல்லிருங்","parts":[{"text":"பல்லிருங்","lemma":"பல்லிருங்","gloss":"many dark"}],"gloss":"many dark","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கூந்தல்","parts":[{"text":"கூந்தல்","lemma":"kūntal","gloss":"hair"}],"gloss":"hair"},{"surface":"மகளிர்","parts":[{"text":"மகளிர்","lemma":"makaḷir","gloss":"women"}],"gloss":"women"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒல்லா","parts":[{"text":"ஒல்லா","lemma":"ollā","gloss":"unyielding/unwilling"}],"gloss":"unwilling"},{"surface":"முயக்கிடைக்","parts":[{"text":"முயக்கிடைக்","lemma":"முயக்கிடைக்","gloss":"in the middle of an embrace"}],"gloss":"in the middle of an embrace","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"குழைக","parts":[{"text":"குழை","lemma":"kuḻaital","gloss":"wither"},{"text":"க","lemma":"-ka","gloss":"may it (optative suffix)"}],"gloss":"may it wither"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"yaṉ","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"தாரே","parts":[{"text":"தார்","lemma":"tār","gloss":"garland"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"-ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"garland indeed"}]}],"literal":"Softly having come, my good feet having bowed to, / 'Give!' saying, if they beg, the glorious / drum-possessing inherited kingship indeed is easy to give, / even sweet life I will give in this land. / The strength of those who have strength not respecting, my / mind/intent scorned, the foolish man, clearly, / like a blind man who tripped over a sleeping tiger, / escaping and returning is indeed impossible. Like the strong, / bamboo-eating elephant's foot caught inside / hard, dense, long bamboo shoot, having gone there, / making him suffer, if I do not fight and conquer, / without evil in their hearts, love not having, / women with many dark tresses of hair, / in their unwilling embrace, may my garland wither!","translation":"If they come softly, bow at my good feet, and beg, 'Give!' I will easily give up this glorious, inherited kingdom with its resonant drums. I would even give my sweet life for them. But that foolish man, who did not respect the strength of the strong and scorned my resolve, is like a blind man who tripped over a sleeping tiger. For him to escape and return alive is impossible. Like a hard, strong, long bamboo shoot crushed under the foot of a powerful, bamboo-eating elephant, if I do not march there and crush him in battle, then let my chest-garland be ruined in the cold, loveless, forced embraces of public women who have dark, abundant hair and no true affection in their hearts.","modern":"பகைவர்கள் மெதுவாக வந்து, என் நல்ல அடிகளைப் பணிந்து, 'கொடு' என்று இரந்து கேட்டால், முரசு பொருந்திய பெருமைமிக்க என் பரம்பரை அரசையும் எளிதாகக் கொடுத்துவிடுவேன்; இந்த உலகத்தில் என் இனிய உயிரையும் தருவேன். ஆனால், வலிமை உடையோரின் வலிமையை மதிக்காமல், என் மன உறுதியை இகழ்ந்த அந்த அறிவிலி, தூங்கும் புலியின் மேல் கால் தடுக்கி விழுந்த குருடனைப் போன்றவன் ஆவான். அவன் தப்பிப் பிழைத்துத் திரும்புவது அரிது. மூங்கிலைத் தின்னும் வலிமையான யானையின் காலில் அகப்பட்டுக் கொண்ட கடினமான, நீண்ட மூங்கில் முளையைப் போல, நான் அவனுடைய நாட்டிற்குச் சென்று அவன் வருந்துமாறு போர் செய்து வெல்லவில்லை என்றால், குற்றமற்ற நெஞ்சத்தில் அன்பு கொள்ளாத, அடர்ந்த கரிய கூந்தலையுடைய பொதுமகளிரின் விருப்பமில்லாத தழுவல்களுக்கு இடையே என் மார்பில் அணிந்துள்ள மாலை கசங்கி அழியட்டும்.","explanation":"This is a vañciṉak kāñci (oath of vengeance) poem spoken by the Chola king Nalangilli. He asserts his royal pride and military might against an arrogant enemy king who has underestimated him. Nalangilli declares that he is extremely generous to those who surrender and beg humbly; he would gladly give away his kingdom or even his life. However, he vows to utterly destroy the foolish enemy who dared to insult his strength, comparing the enemy to a blind man stumbling over a sleeping tiger. He swears that if he does not march to the enemy's land and crush him like a bamboo shoot under an elephant's foot, he should suffer the ignominy of being embraced by loveless courtesans, which would ruin his honor (symbolized by his garland). The imagery of a blind man tripping over a sleeping tiger vividly conveys the enemy's fatal ignorance and the sudden, lethal danger they have provoked.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[1.95,2.4],[2.4,3.0],[3.0,3.2],[3.2,3.3],[3.3,4.6],[4.6,4.9],[4.9,5.4],[5.4,5.7],[5.7,7.94],[7.94,8.3],[8.3,9.2],[9.2,9.5],[9.5,9.8],[9.8,10.0],[10.0,10.5],[10.5,11.6],[11.6,11.75],[11.8,12.3],[12.3,12.9],[12.9,13.3],[13.3,13.5],[13.5,13.6],[13.6,14.0],[14.0,14.4],[14.4,14.7],[14.7,15.0],[15.0,15.3],[15.3,15.6],[17.76,18.26],[18.26,18.86],[18.86,19.26],[19.26,19.36],[19.36,19.76],[19.86,20.26],[20.46,20.86],[20.86,21.31],[21.31,21.56],[21.56,21.76],[21.76,22.43],[22.43,22.56],[22.96,23.46],[23.46,23.76],[23.76,24.76],[24.76,24.96],[24.96,24.96],[24.96,25.66],[25.66,26.09],[26.09,26.16],[26.16,27.26],[27.26,27.66],[27.66,27.66],[27.66,28.95],[28.95,29.27],[29.5,29.61],[29.61,29.84]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.0],[1.0,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[2.0,2.5],[2.5,3.01],[3.2,3.4],[3.4,3.8],[3.8,5.0],[5.0,5.4],[5.4,6.0],[6.0,6.3],[6.7,8.3],[8.3,9.2],[9.2,10.2],[10.2,10.5],[10.5,10.8],[10.8,11.0],[11.0,11.6],[11.6,12.67],[12.71,12.8],[12.8,13.53],[13.66,14.0],[14.0,14.8],[14.8,15.0],[15.0,15.1],[15.1,15.5],[15.5,16.0],[16.0,17.2],[17.2,17.87],[17.87,17.87],[17.87,18.4],[19.68,20.38],[20.38,20.78],[20.78,20.98],[20.98,21.08],[21.08,21.48],[21.48,21.88],[21.88,22.68],[22.68,23.13],[23.13,23.38],[23.38,23.58],[23.58,23.58],[23.58,23.78],[24.2,25.38],[25.38,26.08],[26.08,27.08],[27.08,27.38],[27.38,27.48],[27.48,28.08],[28.08,28.37],[28.37,28.37],[28.37,30.08],[30.08,30.68],[30.68,30.68],[30.68,32.11],[32.11,32.38],[32.38,32.78